  "body": "## Verdict\n\nAdopt T\u2019s selected intake law: one ready game, one PR; blocked research becomes an issue.\n\n## Flow\n\n1. Bathcat commits a complete `ready_for_audit` packet and opens one PR.\n2. `REVISE` returns the same PR to a fresh Bathcat without repository rejection records.\n3. Mennonite adds hash-bound approval in a second commit.\n4. Deterministic promotion occurs in a third commit.\n5. Mennonite merge-commits the final green head; squash/rebase are forbidden for new-game intake.\n\n## Enforcement\n\n- Reject newly committed blocked packets and rejection records.\n- Verify approval and promotion parent commits, allowed paths, and post-approval immutability.\n- Preserve legacy blocked/rejected records as readable history.\n- Add a structured `intake-gap` issue form.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Complete local intake/provenance/fail-closed suite green.\n- Full visual suite green.\n- 2,611 canonical files clean; generated index fresh.\n- Real disposable history fixture passed; post-approval mutation and synthetic squash failed; merge-preserved history passed; fixture removed.",
  "closed_at": "2026-08-01T01:59:48Z",
